# Titan OSI Troubleshooting Readiness Check
# Engineer: skipy | Date: 2026-04-26

## Anomaly 1 - Layer 7: Permission Denied
Symptom: broken_script.sh returned "Permission denied"
Investigation: ls -la showed ---------- (zero permissions)
Fix: chmod 755 ~/forge_v1/broken_script.sh
Result: [+] Heartbeat Detected

## Anomaly 2 - Layer 4: Port Conflict
Symptom: docker run failed with "port is already allocated"
Investigation: sudo ss -tlnp | grep 8080 revealed docker-proxy owning port
Investigation: sudo docker ps identified ghost_web container
Fix: sudo docker rm -f ghost_web
Result: Port 8080 freed, training-web launched successfully

## Anomaly 3 - Layer 3: ICMP Blocked
Symptom: ping returns "Operation not permitted" when DENY OUT icmp rule active
Investigation: sudo ufw status numbered to locate rule number
Fix: sudo ufw delete [rule number]
Result: ping -c 4 8.8.8.8 succeeds

## Self Assessment
- chmod permissions: Confident
- Docker port conflict diagnosis: Confident
- UFW firewall rule management: Confident
- OSI layer identification: Confident
